    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2448\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/05/10/brick-wall-012/material_437/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_437\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2448\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_437.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2448\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/05/10/brick-wall-012/material_437/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_437\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2448 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_437.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/material_437.png\"></p>\n<p>Brick Wall 012 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<p><strong>For Patrons there&#8217;s a 4K resolution version of this texture.</strong></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Oz0Kg_TPRzpI26k_j5vGCxsTP9xabH2e?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a><br>\nAs always it’s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don’t be a prick a tell it’s yours.</h2>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the left menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/N4N259VG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"border: 0; height: 36px;\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?fit=800%2C36&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border: 0; height: 36px;\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\" data-src=\"https://az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?v=0\" class=\" lazyload\"></a></p>\n<p>Or you can be super supportive by becoming a patron on my <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/gendo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Patreon Page.</a> It would mean a LOT to me and you would get a ton of goodies. Take a peak on the rewards you get once you&#8217;ll be my patron.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?c=158505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1414\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/11/16/tiles-007/patreon/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/patreon.png?fit=656%2C290&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"656,290\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"patreon\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/patreon.png?fit=656%2C290&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1414\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/become_a_patron_button%402x.png?resize=434%2C102&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"patreon\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1414\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/11/16/tiles-007/patreon/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/patreon.png?fit=656%2C290&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"656,290\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"patreon\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/patreon.png?fit=656%2C290&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1414 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20434%20102%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"patreon\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\"></a></p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I’ll be posting one every workday with the help of all of my supporters.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://cgcookiemarkets.com/all-products/eren-s-texture-pack-volume-1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3220\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/02/18/bark-pine-001/100texturespack/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/100texturespack.jpg?fit=1288%2C269&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1288,269\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"100texturespack\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/100texturespack.jpg?fit=800%2C167&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3220\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads